  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of Papua New Guinea pro bono legal training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In November 2023 AGS lawyers delivered 5 days of pro bono training on legal analysis, research, writing and statutory interpretation skills in Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea to lawyers within the Department of Justice and Attorney-General. Preparation was also undertaken by AGS lawyers in 2023/2024 for 5 days of pro bono training on legal research, writing and statutory interpretation skills and public speaking and presentation skills to lawyers from the Office of the State Solicitor in July 2024 and for 5 days of pro bono training on procurement and contracting in October 2024 in Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea to lawyers within the Department of Justice and Attorney-General.</narrative>
  </description>
